 103:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****       (#) First, user has to fill the data structure (pointer to
 104:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****           SDMMC_DataInitTypeDef) according to the selected data type to be received.
 105:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_ll_sdmmc.c ****           The parameters that should be filled are:
